This identifier refers to a specific checkpoint within a thread. This can be used to kick off a run of a graph from some point halfway through a thread.

You must pass these when invoking the graph as part of the configurable part of the config, e.g.

```
{"configurable": {"thread_id": "1"}}  # valid config
{
    "configurable": {
        "thread_id": "1",
        "checkpoint_id": "0c62ca34-ac19-445d-bbb0-5b4984975b2a",
    }
}  # also valid config
```
